{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T18:30","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-9193","title":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"4月院线看片指南>>D"},{"text":"值得关注- —8部It's Noteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"《穿普拉达的女王2》\n75\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月30日1第5个周四出品方：二十世纪影业/导演：大卫·弗兰科尔预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5／票房4000-8000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点² 原班人马时隔20年续写新故事。剧情片：女性／喜剧／120‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"在刚刚过去的奥斯卡上，安妮·海瑟薇和《穿普拉达的女王》的原型人物安娜·温图尔携手颁发了最佳服装设计奖，也算是为这部续作提前造势了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"时隔20年后，新作明显带有当下特征，无论题材本身还是创作方法，都在找时下的着力点。情节聚焦在数字时代的纸媒转型，同时又延伸到女性的职场困境。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"导演、演员、制作班底，都是原班人马。不知能否擦出新的火花？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《迈克尔·杰克逊：巨星之路》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"75\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月24日1第4个周五出品方：狮门影业/导演：安东尼·福奎阿预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5／票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点² 据说这次不只是歌功颂德？剧情片：音乐／传记／127″","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一代流行乐之王的传记片，由《波西米亚狂想曲》的制片人监制，主演是迈克尔·杰克逊的亲侄子。据制片方透露，这次不是一味的歌功颂德，而是会呈现这位巨星充满争议的一生。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"片长两个小时，穿插30多首金曲，重现巨星之路以及他生活中的点滴。如此有限的时间内，怎么在庞杂无序的信息里抓住人的特性，将是最大难题。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"估计最差的结果，就是到大银幕去听演唱会了，那好像也能接受？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《阳光女子合唱团》\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月4日1第1个周六（清明档）出品方：星光佳世／导演：林孝谦","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5／票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点 台湾影史最卖座华语片来了！剧情片：温情／女性／134°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片改编自韩国电影《和声》，上映初期表现平平，但随着口碑发酵，票房节节攀升，最终超越了《海角七号》，成为台湾本土市场华语片票房影史第一。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"情节很简单，讲述女子监狱中从四面八方来的狱友，如何跨越起初的冲突、不解、差异，最终组成了合唱团，同唱一首歌。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"典型的温情片路线，非血缘共同体叙事，以及结合时事，又能理解该片为什么能火爆。不过大陆观众观感如何，就是另一回事了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《超级马力欧银河大电影》\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月3日1第1个周五(清明档）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：环球影业&任天堂导演：亚伦·霍瓦斯&迈克尔·杰勒尼克预计：豆瓣分7.0-8.0/票房1.5-2.5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点 超级玛丽粉丝大电影，二度来袭。动画片：喜剧／奇幻／冒险／98‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"该系列前作（2023年）的全球票房超过了13亿美元，而在中国只卖了不到2亿人民币。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部续作在这边大概也就是这个量级吧，主打还是怀旧牌、粉丝向。如果打小没顶过蘑菇、没踩过带刺的乌龟，恐怕是提不起什么兴趣来。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"其实不妨带孩子看看。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《我，许可》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月3日1第1个周五(清明档)出品方：东阳影视/导演：杨荔钠","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分7.0-8.0／票房4000-8000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点00后母单女孩的女性启蒙课。剧情片：女性／喜剧／118‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片从文淇扮演的许可要做妇科手术开始，引出了一连串与女性密切相关的话题，包括不限于：月经羞耻、处女情结、身材焦虑、母女冲突、性（侵）骚扰、悦已小玩具、 ..导演把能想到的都塞进去了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从《春梦》《春潮》，到《我，许可》，能明显看到杨荔钠在处理女性题材上的巨大变化。而这种变化，这种由影像自身直击感官的丰富传达，到姿态言语上的高调动员的转变，比影片本身有意思。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《我的妈耶》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月3日1第1个周五（清明档）出品方：坏猴子&华策／导演：肖麓西预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点你好，李东玉。剧情片：喜剧／家庭／121°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"情节的核心逻辑和《你好，李焕英》相似，都是晚辈透过某种方式，了解了曾经误解的长辈的一生，最后发现自己一直被爱包围。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"只不过《李焕英》用穿越完成，本片用男孩翻阅母亲日记去实现。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"据说马思纯表现不错，想哭一鼻子，可以去看。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《植物学家》\n6.5\n明待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月14日1第3个周二出品方：聿白影业/导演：景一","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房100-300万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点² 又一个毕赣系导演诞生？剧情片：新疆／爱情／奇幻／96‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片去年拿了不少奖，先后在柏林、港影节、北影节都有斩获。也在诸多电影节做了展映，下个月，将在艺联专线上映。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"新疆题材，少年视角，带有奇幻色彩，也受到毕赣不小的影响，影片从对植物的感知，最终进入到对世界的体验。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"标准艺术片，作为新导演，值得关注一下。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《角头：大桥头》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月10日1第2个周五出品方：曼尼娱乐/导演：姚宏易&姜瑞智目前豆瓣分6.2／预计票房600-1500万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点 台湾长青黑帮IP首次登陆。剧情片：黑帮／动作／犯罪／130‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《角头》系列开始于2015年，至今已有十年、五部长片问世。本片算是正片系列的前传之一，单独看也没啥问题。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"眼见影市不行了，上头也是一通下猛料，台湾黑帮、美国恐怖、香港夜总会，全都绿灯放行。但只要红灯随时可能亮起，一切就都只是权宜之计，“临时劫案”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"谨慎观看 ——3部\nPlease Don't Watch !"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 12","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"《天才游戏》\n天才游戏\n5.5\n4月4日全国上映\n期待值 火热预售中"},{"text":"上映日期：4月4日1第1个周六(清明档）出品方：猫眼&华夏／导演：程亮","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5／票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点²存货质量一般都存疑。剧情片：悬疑／犯罪／96‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片2020年就杀青了，但后来被雪藏，原因也是说法不一。雪藏期间，导演没闲着，去《繁花》剧组打工了。如今六年过去，终于被抬出。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"剧情看，就是富少和穷小子互换身份，引发一连串危机，显然受了《燃烧》《寄生虫》的启发。影像也是《默杀》《匿杀》那种伪韩片质感。实在是没什么看头。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 13","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-013.jpg","imageText":"《器子》\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:4月18日1第3个周六出品方：华映娱乐/导演：简学彬目前豆瓣分5.6／预计票房500-1000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点² 复仇片看腻了没？剧情片：动作／犯罪／102‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本月第三部台湾片。这部口碑不佳，但题材更猛，器官买卖、蒙冤入狱、为妻为女独闯龙潭大复仇。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但据说也是塞了太多元素，导致焦点模糊、剧本臃肿.看点也就剩下尺度大了吧（但也没大到哪去","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"四月影院看什么：女性题材特别多 · 配图 14","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9193/fig-014.jpg","imageText":"《北回归线以北》\nWEST BY\nRTHWEST\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月3日丨第1个周五(清明档)出品方：汉唐光影/导演：赵汉唐预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.5／票房100-500万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点²买房买车，不如买房车。剧情片：房车自驾游／公路／110°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"没几天上映了，预告片都没有，封面图也是从海报上截下来的。此外，影片物料基本为零。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"剧情简介讲的是三组人开房车上路，遇见不同的人和尴尬事，最终和解的故事。感觉像房车广告，或是各地文旅项目的宣传片。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"*本文配图来自网络","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"欢迎参与投票！","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"4月片单里，量 ，最想看哪部？单选 单选","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"A.《穿普拉达的女王2》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"B.《阳光女子合唱团》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"C.《迈克尔·杰克逊：巨星之路》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"D.《超级马力欧银河大电影》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"E.《我，许可》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"F.《我的妈耶》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"G.一个都不想看","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"H.路过只看结果","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"投票","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"这个4月，抬眼望去，有不少女性题材电影。从女王到女囚，从妈妈到女儿，不一而足。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"此外还有两个“超级”值得关注：超级巨星迈克尔·杰克逊传记、超级马力欧大电影。再有三个台湾片，也集中登陆。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但总体上，这是个对全年票房不会有太多贡献的月份。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"稿主笔 子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}